<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj retail sales fell 0.6 pct in August.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj retail sales fell 0.6 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Thursday released the following retail sales data for August.</p>
<p>Revised from figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:</p>
<p>    Aug 1996		  July 1996		 Aug 1995</p>
<p>    -0.6 pct		  +2.3 pct		  +1.1 pct</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    Aug 1996		  July 1996		 Aug 1995</p>
<p>    +2.3 pct		  +4.2 pct		  +2.9 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
